      "value": "@{5b21785df50cde783626bd94|full_name}: I've been testing this as well... From what I've found the only thing that's worked for me is to have the seat object disabled by default, have a gesture to enable it, have another to disable it (for desktop mode). Like Fionna said, you have to toggle it on and off after loading in. One additional caveat is that if another avatar loads into the world after you toggled, you have to toggle it again for it to work with that avatar.",
